OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy and dry into the
OL,7,Fevening. Turning cold again under
OL,8,Fclear spells and light winds with a
OL,9,Fgrass frost possible. Cloud builds
OL,10,Flater on and winds freshen.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy to start the day, with
OL,13,Fa band of light rain crossing during
OL,14,Fthe morning. Some bright spells in the
OL,15,Fafternoon. Further patchy rain
OL,16,Ffollows, with fresh winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
